                "body": "A tier added here appears on the triage board immediately, but the tier dropdown in the register's filter bar is a fixed list — it only grows when an editor adds it. And changing a use case's tier does not reclassify the systems already pointing at it: classification is a decision with a date on it, so it is re-made on the system, never rewritten underneath you.",
