                "submitLabel": "Record as not notifiable",
                "title": "notnotifiable",
              },
              {
                "body": "Article 34 has no 72-hour clock — it says **without undue delay**. Tell them in clear, plain language what happened, what it means for them and what they can do. You may skip it only on one of the three grounds in Article 34(3), and the ground has to be recorded.",
                "id": "cmp_sunote",
                "kind": "callout",
                "title": "High risk means telling the people themselves",
                "tone": "info",
              },
              {
                "action": {
                  "actionId": "act_subjnote",
                  "kind": "sequence",
