                "kind": "page_header",
                "subtitle": "Showing every meeting. Pick one on the Meetings screen to narrow this queue.",
                "title": "Review",
              },
              {
                "body": "These rows were read out of a transcript, so they are suggestions. The **Suggested owner** and **Deadline said out loud** columns are the words the transcript used — the app has not assigned anything to anyone. Confirming is where a person takes it on: the form pre-fills with the suggestion so agreeing is one click, and disagreeing is just as easy. Discard keeps the row, marked discarded, so you can see what was proposed and rejected.",
                "id": "cmp_rvnote",
                "kind": "callout",
                "title": "Nothing here is owned yet",
                "tone": "warning",
              },
            ],
            "screen": "scr_review",
            "unsupported": [
              "data_grid",
              "modal",
            ],
          },
          "roles": [
