                "body": "Chasing reviewers is a mail job, not a register job, so this button runs an automation you own. Nothing is wired to it yet: open the app in the builder, pick the automation that should send the reminder, and the button starts working. Everything else here works with no automation, no connector and no Nextcloud.",
                "id": "cmp_rvnote",
                "kind": "callout",
                "title": "The reminder button needs one of your own automations",
                "tone": "info",
              },
            ],
            "screen": "scr_reviews",
            "unsupported": [
              "filter_bar",
              "calendar",
              "data_grid",
            ],
          },
          "roles": [
            "(no role)",
            "dpo",
            "steward",
            "auditor",
          ],
        },
      ],
    },
    {
